<title>USA: Carrollton ISD, Texas, won by Service Asset.</title>
<headline>Carrollton ISD, Texas, won by Service Asset.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Service Asset Management said it won $1.605 million of Carrollton-Farmers Branch Independent School District, Texas, unlimited tax school building bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.4919 percent.</p>
</text>
